---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Passive Yield Lab — questions, corrections, partnership inquiries, or just to compare notes on passive income strategies.">
  <div class="page-content">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>

    <p>
      Have a question about a strategy we covered? Found a factual error you'd like us to correct?
      Interested in working together? We'd love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      The best way to reach us is by email:
      <a href="mailto:hello@passiveyieldlab.com">hello@passiveyieldlab.com</a>
    </p>

    <p>We read every message and typically respond within 48 hours.</p>

    <h2>What We're Happy to Help With</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Questions</strong> — Anything about the strategies, platforms, or tools we cover</li>
      <li><strong>Corrections</strong> — If you spot outdated data, wrong figures, or anything that doesn't look right, please tell us</li>
      <li><strong>Partnerships</strong> — Media inquiries, editorial collaborations, or affiliate partnership proposals</li>
      <li><strong>Reader Stories</strong> — Building passive income yourself? We'd love to hear what's working</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Please note: we don't provide personalised financial advice. For specific investment decisions,
      always consult a qualified financial professional.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
